From: NixOS deployment patch
Subject: [PATCH] retain bounded event streams for active runs

Keep pending SSE events for the lifetime of an active run so clients can
attach after the transport TTL. Bound each queue by event count and serialized
size, reporting any discarded prefix, then apply the existing TTL after the
run becomes terminal.

